      "sha256": "70a3b283f57b4ad031f3f4f6493b33d8cccda01184ab7ba117214bf245cc9c5e",
      "title": "Route return-code service requests by request type",
      "statement": "The return-code service selects its action from the request type (RC-REQUEST-TYPE): 'I' initialises the return-code area (program ID spaces, current and highest code 0, status SUCCESS, response code 0); 'S' records a new return code; 'G' returns the current code, the highest code and the status with response code 0; 'L' inserts one row into DB2 table RTNCODES with the current timestamp, program ID, current code, highest code, status and message, setting response code 0 when the insert succeeds (SQLCODE 0) and 8 otherwise; 'A' analyses logged codes over a time window. Any other request type performs nothing and leaves the response code unchanged.",
      "category": "ROUTING",
      "evidence_status": "verified_from_source",
